<h2>Project overview</h2>
<p>This project explores the design of a fractal end-effector and the use of Finite Element Analysis (FEA) to evaluate its mechanical behaviour.</p>
<h2>Engineering activities</h2>
<ul class="clean-list">
<li>Development and refinement of the end-effector geometry.</li>
<li>Finite Element Analysis to study deformation and stress distribution.</li>
<li>Evaluation of the structure's mechanical performance under defined loading conditions.</li>
</ul>

